e in the  quarterfinals also at the event the  famous family was photographed catching  up with former soccer pro  david beckham it's quite exciting  actually and while kate made appearances  at both athletic events  she was noticeably not in attendance at  the unveiling of the statue of her late  mother-in-law princess diana  in the sunken garden at kensington  palace we  had heard speculation and rumors that  possibly the duchess of cambridge  might have attended but in fact with  this becoming a much more  scaled back engagement than what it was  originally meant to be with  around 100 guests it felt like a fitting  and suitable  crowd of people william and his younger  brother prince harry revealed the statue  together in a private ceremony that  included  several members of diana's family the  spencers  given covid and the restrictions in  place it felt right that it was  william and harry with the spencer side  of the family

